      "id": "claim_be95075cbf5f4763a83575a07d0ca706",
      "statement": "The version-claim checker validates only whether explicitly named MDX package specifiers using `>=` or `==` name releases published on their selected registry; it deliberately does not determine whether a human-chosen minimum version is semantically correct or should be raised.",
