      "id": "claim_99d44b258cf94fa18940213ea5fe2270",
      "statement": "The read-only pull-request workflow runs when MDX content, the checker, its ignore configuration, or the workflow changes; it uses a full-history merge-base diff to send only changed `src/` MDX pages to the checker, skips Python setup when none changed, and otherwise runs on Python 3.13 with a 10-minute timeout.",
